     SUMMARY OF THE INVENTION 
     An object of the present invention is to provide novel alpha substituted oxo- or thio-trifluoromethylketone compounds which inhibit cytosolic phopholipase A2 enzymes that are pro-inflammatory mediators. Some of the derivatives covered by the present invention exhibit increased stability and aqueous solubility. 
